The package supplies headers without an implementation archive. Each consumer
owns one DR_WAV_IMPLEMENTATION, DR_MP3_IMPLEMENTATION and DR_FLAC_IMPLEMENTATION
translation unit as needed. No stdio, wide path, conversion, CRC, container or
SIMD feature macros are imposed. No codec data or private assets are included.

